OL,3,CFrustration for Belfast businesses
OL,4,Cafter three more break-ins
OL,6,FBusinesses in Belfast city centre say
OL,7,Fthey are fearful after more break-ins
OL,8,Fhave occurred over the last number of
OL,9,Fdays.
OL,11,FAt least four businesses have had
OL,12,Fwindows smashed, with some having
OL,13,Fsubstantial amounts of money taken
OL,14,Fwhile a number of arrests have been
OL,15,Fmade.
OL,17,FOne coffee shop was targeted in the
OL,18,Fearly hours of Monday morning in an
OL,19,Fattack which was captured on CCTV,
OL,20,Fwhile the owners could only watch on
OL,21,Fas their premises were robbed.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
