CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785327526
OL,3,CFrustration for Belfast businesses
OL,4,Cafter three more break-ins
OL,6,F"So we were able to, we were able to
OL,7,Fhear them, proclaim oh yeah when they
OL,8,Ffound the till," said Shane McGann.
OL,10,F"They rummaged through the till and
OL,11,Fthey took all the cash they could from
OL,12,Fit, put it out on the ground, smashing
OL,13,Fpretty much everything, so it caused
OL,14,Fquite a bit of a mess behind the bar
OL,15,Fhere.
OL,17,F"And they walked just on down the bar
OL,18,Fand that's when the alarm went off,
OL,19,Fand when the alarm went off then they
OL,20,Fran back out the window."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
