FL,416,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785327526
OL,3,CFrustration for Belfast businesses
OL,4,Cafter three more break-ins
OL,6,FOn top of the stolen money, there was
OL,7,Fa knock-on effect as the business was
OL,8,Fclosed for most of the day and food
OL,9,Fwas then thrown out that the owners
OL,10,Fwere unable to sell.
OL,12,FThere is concern that the break-ins
OL,13,Fare happening on the cusp of Fleadh
OL,14,FCheoil na hEireann next week.
OL,16,FShane McGann continued: "I think
OL,17,Fyou're right in saying that it is a
OL,18,Fbit of a pattern - maybe we're at the
OL,19,Fearly stages of that pattern.
OL,26,@vD@Lrb
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
