PN,41504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785327526
OL,3,CFrustration for Belfast businesses
OL,4,Cafter three more break-ins
OL,6,F"So I hope that over the next week and
OL,7,Fcertainly before the Fleadh, there is
OL,8,Fa bit of a concerted effort from
OL,9,FBelfast City Council and the police,
OL,10,Fand the different bodies that exist,
OL,11,Fto advise businesses on the best way
OL,12,Fof keeping their businesses secure and
OL,13,Fthroughout the Fleadh."
OL,15,FIn the early hours of Tuesday morning,
OL,16,Fthe owners of a fast food restaurant
OL,17,Fwere called by the police to tell them
OL,18,Ftheir business had been broken into.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
