PN,41505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785327526
OL,3,CFrustration for Belfast businesses
OL,4,Cafter three more break-ins
OL,6,FRajiv Prasad said: "So it's around 4
OL,7,Fo'clock, I think, they have come here
OL,8,Fand they broke the window with a beer
OL,9,Fkeg, and you can see the broken window
OL,10,Fhere, and they have come inside and
OL,11,Ftaken the cash from the cash drawer
OL,12,Fand a few drinks from the fridge.
OL,14,F"It was a very disturbing news and it
OL,15,Fwas like a shocking news for me, with
OL,16,Fthe upcoming event next week here in
OL,17,FBelfast city center we are expecting a
OL,18,Flot of crowd and this kind of
OL,19,Fdisturbance is not good for the
OL,20,Fbusinesses."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
