OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785327526
OL,3,CFrustration for Belfast businesses
OL,4,Cafter three more break-ins
OL,6,FThis is now the fourth business in
OL,7,FBelfast city center to have been
OL,8,Fbroken into over the course of the
OL,9,Flast week or so.
OL,11,FIt's also the at least the second
OL,12,Fwhere a beer keg has been used to
OL,13,Fsmash a window. In this particular
OL,14,Finstance, police say they have
OL,15,Farrested two people.
OL,17,FWith all eyes set to be on the city
OL,18,Fnext week for the Fleadh, many are
OL,19,Fhoping these attacks don't overshadow
OL,20,Fthe largest tourist event of the year.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/7
